Package: ep800-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends:
 dkms,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: EP800 / Creative PD1001 USB webcam driver (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree V4L2 driver for Endpoints EP800 based cameras, notably the
 Creative Webcam PD1001 (USB ID 041e:400d).
 .
 The module is rebuilt automatically via DKMS whenever a new kernel is
 installed.
 .
 Protocol and EPLite/Bayer decoding are based on the historical epcam
 driver (GPLv2+).
